0 45 595 [
[(Then with [*~] we do the ring modulation by using the two cosines as the modulating)]
[(signal and we're done! This is the PAF \050phase-aligned formant\051 synthesis algorithm)]
[(\050patented 1993 by IRCAM, the patent ran out in 2011\051.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
