/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 45 748 [
[(For phase coherency, the waveshaper and the cosine pair are driven from the same)]
[([phasor~] object. For each cycle of the [phasor~] we compute the first half-cycle of)]
[(the sine function \050by multiplying by 0.5 and subtracting 0.25 before the cosine)]
[(lookup\051. We apply an index percent to the output of [cos~] and use it for a bell)]
[(curve table lookup.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 45 672 [
[(The table has 200 points but we're effectively just using the second half of it \050a)]
[(whole table is still desired to avoid interpolation issues with guard points\051. At)]
[(phase "0" we start at the top of the gaussian table, at phase "0.5" we move away to)]
[(the limit \050depending on the index percent parameter\051, then we move back to the center)]
[(of the table until reaching phase "1".)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
